# Build context for tools/Muster.CruorMock/Dockerfile is the repo root, so this root-level .dockerignore
# is the one Docker honors. Keep host build artifacts out of the image: a Windows-restored obj/ leaks an
# absolute Visual Studio NuGet fallback path into the Linux container build and breaks `dotnet publish`.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
.git/
.github/
**/*.user
